WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.400
The League Militaire Fleet, centered around the Reineforce Junior and the Jeanne d'Arc,

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:37.860
was bolstered by the Federation Forces in its operation to crush Angel Halo.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:43.360
But defending it on the front line was Fuala's Zanneck.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:50.500
While Üso's V2 did destroy it, the battle lines have not moved.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.460
LOVE LIES AT THE END OF LIGHT

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.660
"Love Lies At The End of Light".
LOVE LIES AT THE END OF LIGHT

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.430
Stop that ship!

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.360
We are Queen Maria's imperial guard.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.660
It looks like a pirate ship.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.260
Is it transporting material from the battlefield?

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.230
This ship's just loaded with enemy mobile suits.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.900
They even have a white one!

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:44.030
A lot of treasure for a pirate ship.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.030
And it's in Angel Halo airspace.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.500
We were transporting goods, got caught in the battle,

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:53.560
and were separated from our main unit. Requesting escort.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:02.860
Miss Marbet, if they figure out who we are,

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.860
please tell them that I'm Maria's daughter.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.230
If you do, they won't hurt us.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:11.460
That may save you, but not us.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.930
I'll say I want you spared.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.000
But will they listen to you?

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.630
Here they come!

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:28.060
Is your entire crew in here?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:28.930
Yes, sir.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.800
Just a woman and children?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.660
Survivors of the Pippiniden fleet...

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.830
...made me do a spacewalk to latch that stuff to the ship!

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.300
Even though you're pregnant?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.200
Yes.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:42.460
Where are your mothers?

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.100
They went to Angel Halo ahead of us.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.100
They just had you people transport captured war material here?

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:54.200
All right, we in the imperial guard will escort you to a safe place.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.160
Sis, thank goodness!

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.330
Now we can see Mom again!

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.860
Thank you so much, Big Brother! Thank you so much, Big Brother!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.300
Big Brother?

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:06.400
How many months?

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.530
Eh? Umm...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.260
I've got about another month to go.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:12.860
So, I wanted it to be blessed by the light of Angel Halo.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.160
May you bear a healthy child.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:18.100
Do you like kids, Kalinga?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.630
Being born a woman, I'd like to be a mother at some point.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:27.400
When this war's over, would you have my baby?

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.500
He just proposed to her, didn't he?!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.760
That wasn't just a slip of the tongue.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.460
I'll wait for the good news.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.930
Kishowl...

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:43.060
A little rough, but he seems like a dependable guy, huh?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.830
I think he's nice.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.760
I've never seen anyone propose before!

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.430
I'm jealous!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.230
He seems like a wonderful man.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.330
Congratulations! Congratulations!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.260
Quiet!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.730
Thanks to you...

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.130
Don't take it out yet!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.600
You should hide a gun in there.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:09.700
Miss Marbet, you have real baby in there.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.000
No way! I couldn't...

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:14.630
Do you?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.930
Not that I know of!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:22.830
People like that might be willing to join us.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:28.800
The imperial guard are trained to give up their lives for Queen Maria.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.360
How do you know that?

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.530
C'mon, they would never betray Queen Maria, right?

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.700
Elisha.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.030
Maybe, but...

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.960
Our job is to transport these psychickers.

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:17.200
We'll discuss what to do with the staff of Blue 3 as well.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.760
Thank you very much.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.800
Hey, Üso. These people in here...

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.000
We met them at Underhook.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.060
They're psychics, being used to power Angel Halo.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.560
You can use people as a power source?

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:34.460
There's a device called a psycommu which can amplify human brainwaves.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.230
They say that thousands of these "psychickers"...

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.130
...have already been sent to Angel Halo.

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:42.930
I never heard my mother mention this, even once.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:46.500
They seem different from the people we saw at Underhook.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.330
They've been brainwashed.

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:01.200
They probably have no idea what they're doing.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.660
Take care, boys.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.630
T-Thanks!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.360
Sorry to bother you!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.660
Work hard!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.900
She's gonna say no to that lieutenant, huh?

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.000
I think she'll say yes.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.800
Bingo!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:26.530
There's something about this airspace that's...

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.060
...frightening.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.200
Shahkti is frightened!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.260
Shahkti? Your Shahkti?!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:39.100
My daughter is close to Angel Halo.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.130
The daughter you sent away six years ago is nearby?

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.230
So says the queen!

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.660
If the princess is here,

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:52.100
then let us send out the imperial guard to find her.

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:55.730
Her senses are even sharper than my own.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:08:00.530
To use Angel Halo's power as best we can...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.560
We'll need to have Shahkti help us, correct?

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.730
Yes.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:08.500
If the energy Angel Halo will emit...

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:12.100
...causes people to forget their warlike natures...

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:16.760
Then let us borrow the princess' power to end this war quickly.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:23.100
And then broadcast a wave preventing humanity from thoughts besides peace...

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.360
...across Earth and all the cosmos!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.260
Yes.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.960
It is for that purpose that Angel Halo exists.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.260
Indeed.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:37.600
We have intruders who came aboard Angel Halo before the queen?!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:39.260
I beg your pardon.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.430
Have the imperial guard find the intruders! Use the radio!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.330
Sir!

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.560
If there are intruders,

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.430
I can only think they were on that ship we took to Blue 3!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:07.630
Did I just invite the enemy in?!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.730
Mission complete over here.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.760
Let's head back to the White Ark.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.800
Shahkti, I'm done over here, too. Let's go.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.630
The mobile suits from before!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.130
Did you people infiltrate intending to blow us up?!

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.160
We won't resist! Please, don't shoot!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:41.500
Üso!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.760
Please don't shoot!

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.930
We aren't going to destroy the space colony!

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.300
You're the kid from that ship!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.560
You're not with the League Militaire, are you?

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:06.460
Now!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.400
Right!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.530
What?! Birdlime?!

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.530
This is how you run a sneak attack! One unit, down!

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:24.860
Don't play games with me!

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.460
The dummy tricked him.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.300
Take this!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.500
Wires inside the dummy?! I was tricked by children?!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.160
Please don't move!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.900
If you don't resist, I won't destroy the mobile suit!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.730
The imperial guard never surrenders!

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:55.900
He ran?!

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:01.500
Lieutenant!

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.600
Kishowl!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:14.660
I have to run!

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:23.200
Damn birdlime!

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.230
Kishowl!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.230
What about your promise to have a child with me?!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:58.530
Didn't you say you had no time to return to Angel Halo?

00:11:58.560 --> 00:11:59.400
Yes.

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:01.800
Avenging Lieutenant Kishowl comes first.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:05.760
That's adorable. And you came here for my help.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.430
I'm familiar with your work, Lt. Commander Fuala.

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:11.230
Shall we sortie, before the white one can escape?

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.560
I need to combat test the Gengaozo, as well.

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:24.530
With an imperial guard mobile suit escorting us,

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:25.960
they shouldn't attack.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:30.100
I hope we're not discovered before we get out of this airspace.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.400
Elisha, Martina, how's it look?

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:37.130
I can still hear the bells coming from Angel Halo, but...

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:39.230
No enemy silhouettes sighted.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:41.860
There's a lot of debris in this area.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.400
Take care of Karl and Flanders.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.860
Sure. What are you doing, Shahkti?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.600
Checking on the prisoner.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:49.560
Be careful.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.430
Right.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.200
Still no meal for me, Miss?

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:01.860
Lieutenant Kishowl, I'm giving you an order.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.100
What?

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:07.200
Please take me back to your unit.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.630
Miss...

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.330
I'm the only daughter of Maria Pure Armonia.

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.730
Do you know what you're saying, Miss?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.400
Lieutenant Kishowl!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.530
Commandant Cronicle Asher is my uncle.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:28.400
I'm going to go to my mother, because I want to assist her...

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:31.930
...in whatever great work she intends for Angel Halo.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:36.760
But Miss, as you can see...

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.460
You're serious?!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.330
I'm like you.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.130
I need to get off this ship.

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:47.530
You're the queen's...

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:50.530
Get me back to your unit, and you can verify it.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.960
What is this? What's going on?

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.800
Don't move, mobile suit!

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.900
For the princess' sake, I'll let you all go.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.000
But leave this airspace at once!

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:10.160
Shahkti!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.800
You let him go, didn't you?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.960
I have to ask my mother about Angel Halo. Nothing else matters.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:21.960
It's impossible. Kagatie controls the queen, right?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:22.730
But...

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.360
I'll shoot the princess, I swear!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:28.100
Don't move! He's taken Shahkti hostage!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.900
Üso, please return Lieutenant Kishowl's mobile suit!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.160
Shahkti's sick again.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.330
What's going on?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.900
Keep back! Don't move!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.430
Come on.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.400
Shahkti did this?

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.300
She probably thinks she can do something about her mother!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.900
Are you all right, Princess?

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:52.730
Yes.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.400
If you move your mobile suits at all, I'll pick them off!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.630
I'm not attacking you now...

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.530
...only because the princess wishes it! Understand?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.660
Shahkti...

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.000
The adult world isn't that simple.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.260
Tomáš, get to your Gun Blaster.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.360
I'm counting on you.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:16.400
White Ark, full speed! Scattering Minovsky particles.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:17.730
They're going after her!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.460
How do you plan to fight him?!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.930
No idea, but I need to make Shahkti understand!

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:29.830
It may be cramped, but please bear with it.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.060
I'm used to it.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.700
If Üso and the others chase us, please shake them off.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.760
Roger that, Princess.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:37.530
Is something wrong?

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:42.630
No, it's just seeing the way you act, I really do think you're a princess.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:52.500
Despite what I said to Miss Marbet, how do I stop the suit with Shahkti in it?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.500
Bells!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.560
Kalinga came to find us?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.060
Good! Princess, we can get away!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:12.100
Kishowl's mobile suit is moving? Kishowl is still alive?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.660
The white one's pilot will use anything.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.560
He specializes in using captured enemy mobile suits!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.560
So, that's how those children operate!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:26.300
I can't let the enemy use Kishowl's mobile suit!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.600
Kalinga!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.830
Kalinga, stop! It's me!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.330
It's moving strangely!

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:48.230
He's using the metal whip! Lt. Commander Fuala!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.830
Hang in there, Princess!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.800
They're attacking Mr. Kishowl?!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.630
They think he's the enemy!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.160
That mobile suit...

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:02.660
Miss Kalinga!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.900
Mr. Kishowl and Shahkti are inside that Rig Shokew!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.100
I have you!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.200
I'm the obvious target! If you're going to attack, attack me!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:20.730
You killed Kishowl, and now you're using his mobile suit!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:23.830
I'll be your opponent, Boy!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.660
The bells!

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.460
The bells are ringing!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:37.730
Don't you recognize me, Kalinga?!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.330
I have the princess in here with me!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.860
That mobile suit belonged to the man I loved!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.900
I won't let you befoul it!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.900
The Minovsky particles are blocking the radio signal!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:55.000
I trained Kalinga as a pilot!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.000
I should be able to let her know it's me from my movements!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.330
Princess!

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.700
Go back to those boys!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.100
They released a dummy doll?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.700
I won't be fooled by that childish trick!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.700
Stop it, Kalinga!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.230
A child befouls it as much as any adult!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:26.030
What?! Kalinga, no!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:30.430
Give me back my Kishowl!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.360
Mr. Kishowl!

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.860
Kalinga, it's me! Kalinga!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.460
Kalinga...

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.430
Kishowl... Why are you still...

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:58.330
Why? Kalinga...

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.260
We were going to have a baby together!

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:05.300
A child... We need to bring it up well...

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.930
Yeah. We will.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:17.960
People who love each other, killing each other.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.400
Why?!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.760
The two of us used to cut training...

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.630
...to swim in this sea of stars.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.330
It was fun...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:40.160
Let's have our wedding right now.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.830
With that as our wedding cake.

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.430
It's pretty...

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.960
I'm so happy... I was able to meet you...

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.030
Kalinga!

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:57.100
I want... three children...

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.230
Sure.

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:01.430
As many as we can have!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:35.130
Give her back!

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.430
I'll take the girl, thank you.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.860
T-That mobile suit...

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:41.900
Üso!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:49.030
We'll have even more fun together, Boy.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.700
I'll see you again soon.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.600
Shahkti...

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.930
I believe I once told you that we want you...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.800
...to become the symbol of the Zanscare Empire, Princess.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:26.530
That time is now close at hand.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.460
I understand.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.360
If you want a symbol, I'll play the part.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:38.100
But first, either take me to the Adrastea or Angel Halo.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:39.960
What?!

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:42.860
Did you not hear my order?

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.530
This little brat!

00:21:57.300 --> 00:22:00.300
I'm sorry, Mr. Kishowl, Miss Kalinga.

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:06.560
I never want to see anyone face your sadness ever again.

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:38.900
The completed Angel Halo begins to exert its mental control.

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:43.360
As Üso's tormented again and again...

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:45.600
...by images of the past and hallucinations,

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.730
he must battle between dreams and reality.

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.060
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:57.030
Next Episode ÜSO DANCES IN HALLUCINATION
"Üso Dances in Hallucination".

00:23:57.030 --> 00:23:58.360
Please watch it!
